# Image builds that use the repo root as their context: core-api and the admin CLI, which bundle
# compute/workflows/ from outside their app directory (see REFCLOUD_IMAGES in scripts/lib/common.sh, and their CI
# workflows). Other images build from their own directory and ignore this file.
#
# An allowlist: list only what those Dockerfiles copy. 'minikube image build' copies the build context into the
# node before building and reads only this file (not per-Dockerfile ignore files), so without it every local build
# would copy the whole repo, node_modules included.
*

# core-api (apps/core-api/Dockerfile)
!apps/core-api/build.gradle
!apps/core-api/settings.gradle
!apps/core-api/gradle.lockfile
!apps/core-api/src

# admin CLI (apps/admin-cli/Dockerfile)
!apps/admin-cli/pyproject.toml
!apps/admin-cli/uv.lock
!apps/admin-cli/README.md
!apps/admin-cli/src

# the bundled workflows, in both images
!compute/workflows

# generated files that can sit inside the directories above
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
